    "helptext": "Oxygen reaeration of a channel by the Churchill et al. (1962) formula, k_a = 5.026 U H^-1.67 (1/day, U in m/s, H in m), suited to deeper, faster rivers. Surface flux area * K_L * theta^(T-20) * (C_s - C) with K_L = k_a*H = 5.026 U H^-0.67 m/day. Attach to dissolved oxygen as an external source on channel blocks.",
